  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e16c44b7d2b4016f9d4345305008ce92d4777642.png\" alt=\"banner\"></p><h3>Pugmeowla's: 我們之中的變形 - 外星進化附加組件，為 Minecraft 1.20.1 新增 Poluseans（內鬼）作為一種變形。</h3><p>此附加組件的目標是盡可能準確地加入《我們之中》的內鬼，主要透過 geckolib 動畫實現。此附加組件的所有方面都力求忠實且準確，同時平衡且整合，以擴充 Omnitrix 的外星人庫。隨著我繼續開發此項目，預計會推出新增功能和結構的更新。</p><p><strong>加入 Discord 伺服器！成為社群的一員，觀看早期預告、提出問題並建議功能！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/W5ZwaQbwan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c261b79b33380118369f4deb3bd4a6ce0df8202f.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/42f9bb962b4558f1f11480e0ab885261c373f482.png\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a947a55948cefe3a8dda706f9a2e9eda11f04d8.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><h2>認識團隊！</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891a2035f50e27ecfc4632ac2ab24ba1d5bddc29.png\" alt=\"pugmeowla\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSpartanGamezFTB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27017ca8ff9d10bf5b737259c2b9e8bb1c2e111a.png\" alt=\"spartan\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/son_lvnMynA?si=aLQwpWSx7NO7AMak\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><h2>要獲得這個外星人，目前需要透過錯誤變形，直到正確的方式完全開發完成。</h2><p>能力 1 - 用舌頭擊殺</p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1473462057046118592/1474999992912449657/polusean2.gif?ex=69eda14a&amp;is=69ec4fca&amp;hm=e5e04ba8d26aaa46b9d4b873f8940d24b1584ae5136e8dbcf7457bc129d73e8d&amp;=&amp;width=1053&amp;height=595\" alt=\"alt text\"></p><p>能力 2 - 用刀擊殺</p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1473462057046118592/1475000897204654302/polusean3.gif?ex=69eda222&amp;is=69ec50a2&amp;hm=4637b9535444f72b8ab2f7f914f084eaecb45dad2926b63efcd5a128787291d2&amp;=&amp;width=289&amp;height=385\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>",
